      "method": [
        "Objective = 4 w\u1d40\u03a3w \u2212 \u03bc\u1d40w + 0.003\u2016w\u2212w_previous\u2016\u2081; equal weights on exactly three of eight assets. Covariance is positive definite by construction.",
